      "text": " <think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 73 and 74, we can use the distributive property of multiplication over addition. This property allows us to break down the multiplication into simpler parts. Specifically, we can express 74 as 73 + 1. This will help us use the distributive property to simplify the calculation.\n</think>\n<answer>\nUsing the distributive property, we can write:\n\\[ 73 \\times 74 = 73 \\times (73 + 1) \\]\nBy the distributive property, this becomes:\n\\[ 73 \\times 73 + 73 \\times 1 \\]\nSince \\( 73 \\times 1 = 73 \\), we can simplify this to:\n\\[ 73 \\times 73 + 73 \\]\nNow, we need to calculate \\( 73 \\times 73 \\). We can use the formula for the square of a binomial, \\((a + b)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2\\), where \\(a = 70\\) and \\(b = 3\\):\n\\[ 73^2 = (70 + 3)^2 = 70^2 + 2 \\times 70 \\times 3 + 3^2 \\]\nCalculating each term separately:\n\\[ 70^2 = 4900 \\]\n\\[ 2 \\times 70 \\times 3 = 420 \\]\n\\[ 3^2 = 9 \\]\nAdding these together:\n\\[ 73^2 = 4900 + 420 + 9 = 5329 \\]\nSo, we have:\n\\[ 73 \\times 73 = 5329 \\]\nNow, substituting back into our expression:\n\\[ 73 \\times 74 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5329 + 73 = 5